status GREEN -- gitlink_dependent GREEN with probe (37 control legs, fail=0, three mutations bitten), reds_ledger_monotone GREEN, remember_git_nib GREEN; log_has_a_row and session_roster_agree GREEN after the pin repair; cold roster pass still running at send, named honestly
recommend check-in (Keaton) -- the 38 read clean and are rostable today behind `capability tigerbeetle_clone`, which is 38 roster rows and a hand's call; and the REDS bound is sized for 8 open rows against 9 that cannot fold
